{"version":1,"content":"\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thecollectivehk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>大埔宏福苑一周年，入夜氣氛寂靜，市民悼念方式各有不同，有人舉起白紙，無聲肅立；有人獻上百花，拜三拜；有人互相擁抱，或遞上紙巾。有宏福苑居民咽泣，獻花時顫抖不止；有市民帶上白板，寫下168位遇難者的姓名，寫到最後，淚流着說「香港人、大埔人，不會忘記。」11 月 26 日，一整夜，哭泣聲不盡，獻花者不斷，直至凌晨12時，人群逐漸散去。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:34:39.764432+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:11:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:34:57.456046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:03.784342+00:00","content_hash":"23d043767dcd5e0ffd5a8ccaad78da666cce3bd6d0bfe99342aa7cf03966b1a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}